{"id": "16-3010-2-4", "zh": "Dhasa，意为拾取。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-3010-5-8", "zh": "Dhāseti、dhāsayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3011-2-4", "zh": "Bhasa，意为拿取。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-3011-5-8", "zh": "Bhāseti、bhāsayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3012-2-4", "zh": "Pusa，意为佩戴。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-3012-5-12", "zh": "Poseti、posayati，意思是佩戴装饰品。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-3013-2-7", "zh": "Tusi、pisi、kusi、dasi，意为言说。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-3013-8-11", "zh": "Tuṃseti、tuṃsayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3013-12-15", "zh": "Piṃseti、piṃsayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3013-16-19", "zh": "Kuṃseti、kuṃsayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3013-20-23", "zh": "Daṃseti、daṃsayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3014-2-4", "zh": "Khusi，意为辱骂。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-3014-5-8", "zh": "Khuṃseti、khuṃsayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3014-9-10", "zh": "Khuṃsanā（辱骂）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-3015-2-4", "zh": "Gavesa，意为寻求。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-3015-5-8", "zh": "Gaveseti、gavesayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3015-9-16", "zh": "Gavesako（寻求者）、gavesito（被寻求的）、gavesanā（寻求）、gaveṭṭhi（寻觅）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-3016-2-4", "zh": "Vāsa，意为亲近。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-3016-5-8", "zh": "Vāseti、vāsayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3016-9-12", "zh": "Vāso（居住）、āvāso（住处）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-3017-2-4", "zh": "Hisi，意为伤害。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-3017-5-8", "zh": "Hiṃseti、hiṃsayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3018-2-4", "zh": "Nivāsa，意为遮覆。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-3018-5-9", "zh": "穿上衣服（vatthaṃ nivāseti）、nivāsayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-3018-10-12", "zh": "在上午时分穿好下衣。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-3019-2-5", "zh": "Aṃsa，意为聚合。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-3019-6-9", "zh": "Aṃseti、aṃsayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3019-10-13", "zh": "Aṃso、aṃsā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3020-2-9", "zh": "这里，**aṃso** 既指部分，也指肩膀。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-3020-10-13", "zh": "**Aṃsā** 是指痔疮。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-3021-2-4", "zh": "Misa，意为准备。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-3021-5-8", "zh": "Meseti、mesayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3022-2-4", "zh": "Rasa，意为品尝。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-3022-5-8", "zh": "Raseti、rasayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3022-9-10", "zh": "Raso（味）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-3022-11-15", "zh": "被人们品尝、享用，所以叫作 raso（味）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-3023-2-4", "zh": "Rasa，意为爱恋。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-3023-5-8", "zh": "Raseti、rasayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3023-9-10", "zh": "Raso。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3024-2-6", "zh": "这里，**rasetī** 的意思是爱恋。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-3024-7-28", "zh": "**Raso** 是指情爱；以情爱相连结，就叫作和合之味。婆罗门们就是指这个而对世尊说：“沙门乔达摩是无味的人。”", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-3025-2-4", "zh": "Siya，意为不全部使用（即剩余）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-3025-5-8", "zh": "Seseti、sesayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3025-9-10", "zh": "Seso（剩余）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-3025-11-29", "zh": "加前缀 vi 表示超胜，加前缀 vi 表示超胜；加前缀 vi 的词根 sisa 用于超胜的意思：viseseti、visesayati。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-3025-30-35", "zh": "Viseso（殊胜）、visiṭṭho（殊胜的）、visesanaṃ（区别）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-3026-2-4", "zh": "Missa，意为混合。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-3026-5-8", "zh": "Misseti、missayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3026-9-12", "zh": "Sammisseti、sammissayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3026-13-23", "zh": "Misso、misso、missito、sammissito、sammisso 等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-3026-24-33", "zh": "在《阿蓝布萨本生》里，**missā** 是对女人的称呼，因为她们与男人混杂在一起。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-3027-2-4", "zh": "Jusa，意为思量。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-3027-5-8", "zh": "Joseti、josayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3028-2-4", "zh": "Masa，意为欢笑。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "16-3028-5-8", "zh": "Maseti、masayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3029-2-4", "zh": "Marisa，意为忍耐。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-3029-5-6", "zh": "Mariseti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3029-7-8", "zh": "Marisayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3030-2-4", "zh": "Pisa，意为派遣。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-3030-5-8", "zh": "Peseti、pesayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3030-9-12", "zh": "Pesako（派遣者）、pesito（被派遣的）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-3031-2-5", "zh": "Ghusa，意为发声。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-3031-6-9", "zh": "Ghoseti、ghosayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3031-10-13", "zh": "他们满心欢喜，在菩提道场高声宣告。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-3031-14-15", "zh": "Ghoso（声音）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-3032-2-4", "zh": "Disī，意为宣说。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-3032-5-8", "zh": "Deseti、desayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3032-9-16", "zh": "Desako（说者）、desetā（宣说者）、desito（被宣说的）、desanā（教导）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-3033-2-4", "zh": "Vasa，意为遮覆。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-3033-5-8", "zh": "Vāseti、vāsayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3033-9-12", "zh": "Nivāseti、nivāsayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-3033-13-14", "zh": "Vatthaṃ（衣服）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-3034-2-4", "zh": "以上是以 sa 结尾的词根的词形。", "confidence": 80}
